OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 17, released after scaling
OL,4,Atelecoms tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has been released
OL,7,Fwithout charge after he scaled a
OL,8,Ftelecoms tower, resulting in road
OL,9,Fclosures in Northampton town centre.
OL,11,FThe incident unfolded behind a Lidl
OL,12,Fstore in Towcester Road between 11:30
OL,13,Fand 13:30 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe teenager was arrested on suspicion
OL,16,Fof causing a public nuisance and
OL,17,Finterfering with national
OL,18,Finfrastructure.
OL,20,FBut Northamptonshire Police confirmed
OL,21,Fhe would now face no further action.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
